# Task List: NOTION-ALT Stitch → Perfect Functional App

## Context
The `NOTION-ALT` project is a Next.js 14 app with:
- **Backend**: Prisma + SQLite, NextAuth (email/password), full REST API for workspaces/pages/blocks/search
- **Frontend**: Basic functional pages using gray/blue Tailwind styles — completely diverged from the "mono_prism" design system
- **Stitch folder**: 4 high-fidelity HTML prototypes (`dashboard_light_mode`, `document_editor_dark_mode`, `kanban_board_view`, `rich_document_editor`) demonstrating the target design — "The Digital Architect" soft minimalism system

**Goal**: Convert every page of the Next.js app to match the stitch prototypes pixel-perfectly, fix all non-functional interactive elements, wire up real data, and ensure everything works end-to-end.

